  "portfolio": "You just built an agent that turns a messy invoices/ folder into a clean, queryable tracker with built-in duplicate and overdue detection -- and a numeric consistency check that catches a bad extraction before it reaches your books. Take a screenshot of your Invoice Tracker sheet with a few processed rows (redact real vendor/amount info if needed), and add \"Invoice Processing Agent\" to your build portfolio.",
